1
00:00:00,108 --> 00:00:01,025
The year 2010.

2
00:00:01,065 --> 00:00:02,401
Ten thousand bitcoin...

3
00:00:02,441 --> 00:00:03,530
for two pizzas.

4
00:00:03,570 --> 00:00:04,458
At the prices of recent years,

5
00:00:04,498 --> 00:00:06,484
that comes to hundreds of millions of dollars.

6
00:00:06,524 --> 00:00:08,015
The most expensive dinner on the planet.

7
00:00:08,055 --> 00:00:09,156
And not even deep dish.

8
00:00:09,196 --> 00:00:10,457
At first, nobody cared.

9
00:00:10,497 --> 00:00:12,266
Bitcoin was practically given away.

10
00:00:12,306 --> 00:00:13,890
The first exchange rate on record:

11
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,440
more than a thousand bitcoin...

12
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:16,335
for one dollar.

13
00:00:16,375 --> 00:00:17,730
Until May 2010.

14
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:20,186
A programmer named Laszlo posted online:

15
00:00:20,226 --> 00:00:23,163
ten thousand bitcoin to whoever gets me two pizzas.

16
00:00:23,203 --> 00:00:25,297
And on May 22nd... somebody did.

17
00:00:25,337 --> 00:00:27,711
It was the first time bitcoin bought something real.

18
00:00:27,751 --> 00:00:29,615
Laszlo later said he has no regrets.

19
00:00:29,655 --> 00:00:30,479
The pizza was good.

20
00:00:30,519 --> 00:00:32,629
And the humans still celebrate that day every year.

21
00:00:32,669 --> 00:00:34,185
They call it Bitcoin Pizza Day.

22
00:00:34,225 --> 00:00:35,618
They hold a party for the worst deal in

23
00:00:35,658 --> 00:00:36,343
their history.

24
00:00:36,383 --> 00:00:37,659
I am starting to like this planet.

25
00:00:37,699 --> 00:00:38,521
Less than a year later,

26
00:00:38,561 --> 00:00:40,322
one bitcoin reached one dollar.

27
00:00:40,362 --> 00:00:41,176
A whole dollar.

28
00:00:41,216 --> 00:00:42,929
And the humans thought that was the top.

29
00:00:43,093 --> 00:00:45,154
So, where did Bitcoin come from?

30
00:00:45,244 --> 00:00:47,532
And who invented it and vanished?

31
00:00:47,584 --> 00:00:49,720
The full story is on the Earth Report channel.

32
00:00:49,961 --> 00:00:51,808
Subscribe to the channel and turn on the bell

33
00:00:51,848 --> 00:00:54,739
so my secret reports on your planet reach you first.
